  "question": {
    "text": "The maximum wavelength of radiation that can produce photoelectric effect in certain metal is 200 nm. What is the maximum kinetic energy (in electron-volt) acquired by the electron due to radiation of wavelength 100 nm?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6.2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, <math><msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>;</mo></math><br /><br />maximum KE <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1240</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>6.2</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>",
